# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend environment variables – LOCAL DEVELOPMENT
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# LOCAL DEV  → keep as /api so Vite proxy routes → http://127.0.0.1:8000
# PRODUCTION → handled by frontend/.env.production (auto-selected by Vite)
